    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526790/extras/2949f0c7ff313fbb2eeedaf17b2943ab.poster.avif?t=1751476885\" width=616 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526790/extras/2949f0c7ff313fbb2eeedaf17b2943ab.webm?t=1751476885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526790/extras/2949f0c7ff313fbb2eeedaf17b2943ab.mp4?t=1751476885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526790/extras/867a7a92b25eca1588169ab4520f99cc.webp?t=1751476885\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand and personalize your shop by purchasing shelves, refrigerators, and essential licenses.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory, set competitive prices, and craft strategies to attract more customers and boost your income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526790/extras/dbd03406bb51a220e10f673802a2f8d1.poster.avif?t=1751476885\" width=614 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526790/extras/dbd03406bb51a220e10f673802a2f8d1.webm?t=1751476885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526790/extras/dbd03406bb51a220e10f673802a2f8d1.mp4?t=1751476885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\